          "name": "qmailing_get_attachment",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:9f4a6ce2a4066eeba7cdd13df3e34059478d7436ce64b66f5479ea0df53e9c51",
          "description": "Download an attachment from an email and return its bytes as base64. Use after qmailing_get_email when the user asks to inspect, summarise, or forward an attachment. Inline payload is capped at 5 MiB — over the cap the tool returns { tooLarge: true, sizeBytes } instead of contentBase64, and the user has to fetch the file through the web UI. Attachments QMailing quarantined as risky (quarantined=true in qmailing_get_email) return { quarantined: true, message } — do not retry; tell the user it was blocked for safety.",
          "is_mutating": false,
          "property_keys": [
